From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:41:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): fence duplicate remote answers before comment
 insertion [daveey]

Reject whitespace operation IDs before writes, re-read existing receipts under the transaction lock before reason comments, and preserve the module internal_error envelope for unexpected exceptions. Add deterministic two-connection delivery races for both modes and all 15 requested survivor guard regressions. RED12 then GREEN42, composed354 passed and all15 guard mutants killed. PR347 coordinated lifecycle repair is separately tested with the real Courier.
